# Dragon Fangs (Q038): a level 19 character holding 99 feather ornaments and 49 dragon teeth accepts
# at Luis. One Langk sentinel brings the hundredth ornament (the cond moves); Luis trades them for a
# tooth of totem, which Iris trades for her letter, which Rohmer trades for his; Iris takes it. One
# Langk shaman brings the fiftieth tooth (both drop rolls pinned to land); Iris takes the teeth and
# pays the reward the pinned roll picks (index 2: a 1123 and 3200 adena); the quest completes; then
# relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q038_dragon_fangs.golden
character Fang 19
hold 7173 99
hold 7175 49
random 0 0 2
script quest.Q038_DragonFangs
item 7173 7174 7175 7176 7177 45 627 1123 605
page guard/30386.htm
page trainer/30034.htm
page trainer/30344.htm
page script/quest/Q038_DragonFangs/
npc luis 30386 Guard 10 0 0
npc iris 30034 Trainer 20 0 0
npc rohmer 30344 Trainer -20 0 0
npc sentinel 21100 Monster 0 40 0
npc shaman 21101 Monster 0 -40 0

